[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露！我们再好好谈谈吧！<br>根本不需要做这种事啊！|#0105Bad01_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐……|#0105Bad01_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛紧紧握住梅露露的手，<br>拼命地诉说。|#0105Bad01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL7

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露你是我的朋友啊！<br>所以你根本没必要……|#0105Bad01_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐，谢谢你。<br>能听到你这样说，我真是太高兴了。|#0105Bad01_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛小姐对我来说，<br>果然是无可替代而珍贵的朋友呢。|#0105Bad01_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:面对静静微笑的梅露露，<br>艾玛的眼中闪现出一丝希望的光芒。|#0105Bad01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:那、那么！你——|#0105Bad01_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

