[PrintTextModified Text:……对不起，大家。<br>你们都是非常好的人。|#0105Bad01_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我绝对不会忘记大家的……|#0105Bad01_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:看着滚落在地的三颗头颅，<br>梅露露静静地流下泪水。|#0105Bad01_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:寂静的时间持续了几秒钟。|#0105Bad01_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不久，梅露露擦干眼泪……|#0105Bad01_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:坚毅地在胸前握紧双拳。|#0105Bad01_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:……好了！<br>让我们努力准备下一轮吧！|#0105Bad01_Meruru008| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

