[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的脚步声在地下回响，<br>她正在巡视牢房。|#0105Bad01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露大人，那个……遗体已经处理完毕了。|#0105Bad01_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你。<br>这次看来会很忙啊。|#0105Bad01_Meruru009| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:毕竟留下了很多线索呢。<br>在下一批预备魔女来之前，<br>必须要确实地消除痕迹才行。|#0105Bad01_Meruru010| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:地下也有些损坏，<br>好像还发现了奈叶香小姐的涂鸦。|#0105Bad01_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:必须更加、更加彻底地<br>消除所有令人担忧的东西……|#0105Bad01_Meruru011| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:这次的预备魔女相当优秀呢。<br>梅露露大人好几次都差点哭出来了。|#0105Bad01_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:真是的，我才没有哭呢。<br>……咦？|#0105Bad01_Meruru012| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说着，梅露露捡起房间角落里掉落的纸片，<br>仔细阅读起来。|#0105Bad01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:……您在读什么？|#0105Bad01_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:似乎是雪莉小姐写给艾玛小姐的信……|#0105Bad01_Meruru013| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露随即开始轻声啜泣。<br>她小心翼翼地将信件抱在胸前。|#0105Bad01_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Cry

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉小姐真是个重视朋友的人呢。<br>看到如此美丽的友情，我真的很感动。|#0105Bad01_Meruru014| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:谢谢你们给予我这宝贵的时光。|#0105Bad01_Meruru015| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:被玛格小姐改造过的牢房<br>也得修复呢……唉。|#0105Bad01_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，是的。装扮得那么可爱，<br>真有点可惜呢。|#0105Bad01_Meruru016| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露用附近的灯笼点燃了信，<br>然后随意地将其扔在走廊的角落。|#0105Bad01_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:12_1

[PrintTextModified Text:之后，梅露露花费了大量时间，<br>有时甚至通宵达旦，巡视了每个房间。|#0105Bad01_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这一切都是为了迎接下一批预备魔女的准备工作——<br>恢复原状。|#0105Bad01_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:红色的蝴蝶……？|#0105Bad01_Meruru017| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露拿着一本打开的书，<br>恍惚地看着窗边飞舞的红色蝴蝶。|#0105Bad01_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:与此同时，典狱长一个飞扑，<br>迅速地叼住蝴蝶吞了下去。|#0105Bad01_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:咕噜噜……失礼了。是诺亚小姐的魔法啊。<br>这次也出现了【不会消失的魔法】呢。唉……|#0105Bad01_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这可真麻烦啊……<br>无法消除的痕迹实在太多了。|#0105Bad01_Warden007| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:比如中庭的彩虹，还有图书室的那个。|#0105Bad01_Warden008| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长厌恶地看向<br>图书室里盛开的樱花。|#0105Bad01_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:我觉得很漂亮，所以蛮喜欢的哦。|#0105Bad01_Meruru018| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但是说不好会在某种情况下，<br>以某种方式帮到囚犯们……|#0105Bad01_Meruru019| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露面露难色笑了笑。|#0105Bad01_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:这时，看守发出爬行般的沙沙声<br>向她靠近。|#0105Bad01_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:它用身上的多只手拿着好几本书，<br>将其中一本递给了梅露露。|#0105Bad01_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，这本书里也写着大魔女大人的事吗？|#0105Bad01_Meruru020| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守缓缓点头。<br>看到这个回答，梅露露的脸瞬间变得通红。|#0105Bad01_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Flushed

[PrintTextModified Text:哇啊啊……！谢谢你！|#0105Bad01_Meruru021| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:她像个孩子一样，小心翼翼地抱住书本。|#0105Bad01_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:只要找一下还是能找到的呢……<br>当玛格小姐开始解读的时候，我可紧张坏了……|#0105Bad01_Warden009| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:相比被发现，只要能看到一点点大魔女大人的记录，<br>对我来说就很高兴了。|#0105Bad01_Meruru022| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:28_1

[PrintTextModified Text:就这样，监牢中一成不变的日子<br>今天也依然延续下去。|#0105Bad01_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不——<br>即使有什么变化，一切最终都会恢复原状。|#0105Bad01_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:几天后，大致完成复原工作的梅露露<br>和典狱长在中庭摆开了茶具。|#0105Bad01_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:话说回来，我决定在监牢里<br>放一台DVD播放器了。<br>典狱长先生，你觉得这里面哪个比较好呢？|#0105Bad01_Meruru023| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露将手中的DVD包装盒<br>展示在典狱长面前。|#0105Bad01_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:我在想下次也得用这类方法<br>给她们施加压力，<br>不过一直不知道选哪个好……|#0105Bad01_Meruru024| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:《最恐怖的灵异地点影像》<br>《世界上最可怕的灵异照片》|#0105Bad01_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到这些标题，<br>典狱长轻轻叹了口气。|#0105Bad01_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:……随便哪个都行吧？<br>哪个看起来都很无聊……|#0105Bad01_Warden010| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:那就都放吧。<br>希望这样<br>能加快魔女化的进程……|#0105Bad01_Meruru025| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:这种东西真的能加快吗……？<br>无论怎么想，感觉都不会有人看……|#0105Bad01_Warden011| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:比这更重要的是，我希望您能从上次的预备魔女中<br>选择下一个看守。|#0105Bad01_Warden012| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，对了。<br>这次该让谁当看守呢。|#0105Bad01_Meruru026| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:请选个好控制的人吧。<br>如果还留有反抗意识的话会很麻烦……|#0105Bad01_Warden013| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:话说回来，DVD播放器<br>是什么时候订购的啊？|#0105Bad01_Warden014| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我还以为梅露露大人<br>不懂电子设备呢。|#0105Bad01_Warden015| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:呵呵。<br>请不要把我当成老婆婆。|#0105Bad01_Meruru027| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我从珍贵的朋友们那里<br>学到了很多东西呢。|#0105Bad01_Meruru028| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:特别是……那个人给我留下了深刻的印象。<br>艾……艾……|#0105Bad01_Meruru029| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露话说到一半，<br>带着不太自信的微笑开口道。|#0105Bad01_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:艾娜？|#0105Bad01_Meruru030| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:是艾玛。|#0105Bad01_Warden016| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露和典狱长一边轻松地交谈，<br>一边继续品茶。|#0105Bad01_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在下一场惨剧开始之前的短暂时光里，<br>监牢正包裹在寂静之中。|#0105Bad01_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

